(S5m - WHILE with spaces on BOTH sides of the condition. Run only if S5l also failed.)
(NO MOTION. Terminates after 3 passes if the loop opens at all.)
(READ #190 - 3 means WHILE WORKS with this spacing. 1 or an error at END1 means it did not open.)
#190 = 0
#191 = 3
WHILE #190<#191 DO1
#190=#190+1
END1
M30
